      "side": 1,
      "message": "You need to be a little careful here - VmInstance expects to handle callbacks from the VM, which it will never get, so the state will never be correct.\n(I guess you\u0027ll also need some polling loop to figure out if the VM\u0027s vsock is ready to connect to - or will we handle that as a connection from the VM to us?)",
