      "writtenOn": "2023-08-30T08:37:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. I noticed that for ordinary VM this is 10MB[1], I don\u0027t think it needs to be so big for the service VM. Since only pvmfw saves the encrypted VM secret in it, I chose a smaller size. It\u0027s probably still too big for the current usage. Would you like to make it even smaller?\n\n[1] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/javalib/src/android/system/virtualmachine/VirtualMachine.java;l\u003d197;drc\u003d29526dd8c067e8b7635d9fbf0e3e542c76f251da",
      "parentUuid": "871a22b6_2fd8eeb2",
